{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8e87e41c-62c4-84ba-925d-1c0f1a8071fd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T11:10:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Miguel Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Um, I have a, a problem with the trash. Big trash, not the regular one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bulk items? Furniture, mattresses, that kind of thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, bulk. My landlord, he, um, he moved out the tenant and he left everything on the curb. A couch, a mattress, two chairs, boxes. It is there since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a lot. And you said landlord, so is this your building, or the one next to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, next door is his. I am the owner of my house. But the pile is, it is in front of my house, half and half. I do not want the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. What's the address where the pile is sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "402 Carroll Avenue. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-two Carroll Avenue. Got it. I'll put in a report for a bulk pickup check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And, um, is there a fee? For this pickup? Because it is not mine. I do not want to pay for his couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk pickup can carry a fee, but that normally goes to whoever the items belong to. I'll note that you're a neighbor reporting it, and the landlord's the one who left it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That is good. Sorry, one second, I am doing the crossword here, in pen, always in pen, and I am stuck. Seven letters, um, 'puts off.' Starts with D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, let me think. Delays? That's seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Delays. D-E-L-A-Y-S. That is six. No, wait. Defers! Seven. Defers, yes. Thank you, it fits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Defers, there you go. Good thing you didn't write mine in pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ha. Okay. So the pile, somebody will come look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I'll read it back: bulk waste left at the curb at 402 Carroll Avenue after a move-out, reported today. Can I have a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0159."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0159. Someone will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
